{"asset_key":"ep3/quest_story_13217970","episode":"ep3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"13217970","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:1:1321797001:0":{"text":"我已经为亚莲娜整理好遗容了……瞧，她的面容多么安宁。","source_cn":"我已经为亚莲娜整理好遗容了……瞧，她的面容多么安宁。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA669DA8BD6C547C4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1321797002:0":{"text":"你们……要送她去大教堂了吗？","source_cn":"你们……要送她去大教堂了吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAF7CB5DDE1BBDDAB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1321797003:1":{"text":"嗯，该为大公阁下和公主殿下举办葬礼了。","source_cn":"嗯，该为大公阁下和公主殿下举办葬礼了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD13295361D5961B9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1321797004:1":{"text":"大公阁下的遗物只有他随身佩戴的宝剑，我已经派侍卫去取了。","source_cn":"大公阁下的遗物只有他随身佩戴的宝剑，我已经派侍卫去取了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x71E1D34077B7DB68","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1321797005:1":{"text":"现在……将公主殿下挪入冰棺中吧。这是修士修女和雪松镇的矮人们，为她献上的最后一份礼物。","source_cn":"现在……将公主殿下挪入冰棺中吧。这是修士修女和雪松镇的...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB0EBEF89C44A079C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_